{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-onboarding-db-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-3","surface":"phone","area":"phone/onboarding-db","refs":["F-phone-1604","F-phone-1605","FN-B-switch-phone-lib-core-02"],"severity":"S3","title":"After a member found by number joins the gym, linking them to the gym's member list can fail silently and is never tried again","what":"When a member proves their number and joins the gym they were found in, the app hands the proof in on its own afterwards so the gym's list entry is linked and the member's plan opens the paid features. The proof is kept only in the app's memory for 15 minutes. If the join lands after that, the app was closed in between, or the gym server refuses or cannot be reached, the link is dropped with only a line in the phone's own log. The member is still told they were set up in the gym; nobody on the phone or at the desk is told the link did not happen, and it is never tried again. The code's own note says the desk confirms the number instead, but nothing asks the desk to.","expected":"A failed or expired link is kept and tried again, or the member and the desk are told the number still needs confirming, so the member's paid features and the desk's list match.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/onboarding/phoneSignInApi.ts:80-87","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/phoneSignInApi.ts:122-148","apps/mobile/src/shop/findGymApi.ts:86-91","apps/mobile/src/shop/findGymApi.ts:104-124","apps/mobile/src/plan/planSync.ts:93-98"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"number-link-after-join-not-retried","who":"members found by their number and their gym's desk","how_often":"whenever the join is slow, the app closes, or the server refuses or is offline at that moment","fix_line":"Keep the proof until the link is confirmed and retry it, or show the member and the desk that the number still needs confirming","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
